In STRATEGO you get the following pieces.

1 - Marshal   2 - Generals   2 - Colonels   2 - Majors   2 - Captains
2 - Lieutenants   2 - Sergeants   2 - Miners   2 - Scouts   2 - Bombs
1 - Flag

You will see the board and your cursor will be placed in the first spot that you may place a piece.  Just hit the number of the piece to place it and your cursor will move automatically.  (1 is a Marshal - 9 is a Scout, B for BOMB and F for FLAG)  When all your pieces are placed you may do one of two things. Move one of your pieces or quit the game.

That's all to STRATEGO.  Have fun.
